Description: Code editor based on Code - OSS without Microsoft services or AI features
 VSebCode is a code editor built from the Code - OSS sources with the
 Microsoft-specific online services and the AI features removed. It keeps the
 editor, the integrated terminal, debugging, Git integration and the extension
 model. See https://github.com/sebastian-suarez/VSebCode for installation
 instructions.
